Beta_Binomial_Rate_Calibration.Rmd contains the final fitting approach. 
It uses updated fire location and correctly aggregated striek counts: 
"lightning_ignition_jja_2002_2011_new_no_outliers.csv"
It tests a rate calibration shift on glm fit models to check that the shift is 
necessayr. It then fits a bayes version of the beta binomial and applies the final 
rate shift. 

beta_binomial_ignition.stan contains the stan code for this beta binomial model

Beta_Binomial_vs_Binomial_Logistic_Regression_Rate_Calibration.Rmd:
compares previsously used binomial logistic regression with a beta binomial model
beta bnomial outperforms

Random_Forest.Rmd: checks for predictor imortance from the updated drivers, 
"lightning_ignition_jja_2002_2011_new_no_outliers.csv"

revalibration.Rmd is a relic from previous approaches. With the updated drivers, 
the model does not need a secondary rate calibration. 
